    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Jesse Albert",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102817087001838806571/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIkk0sSlRw0GORl0uXGA7dr2H4xG9Xsl3rIP6JeJL78AwNAlQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "I recently had the pleasure of working with the Arketek Team on a Salesforce Maps installation, and I couldn't be more impressed with the results. The entire process went exceptionally well. David and Eric’s deep knowledge of Salesforce made the project smooth and straightforward, and we are already seeing a large increase in booked appointments with clients and prospects.",
        "time": 1705628254,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "James Smith",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107342670131665828957/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJ-BFb_qj6Lk06ENeJxdyBn54iN_plnQiTE_ILAu9QMC3URdQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "I want to thank the Arketek team for supporting my Salesforce implementation. It was a great experience working with Eric. He was exceptionally intelligent and patient with us. The dashboard he built for us is a hit! We connected ZoomInfo and PhoneBurner to Salesforce and this has boosted activity with efficiency and excitement for my sales team. Exceptional work!",
        "time": 1701443464,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Nadav Shenker",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111290669133260088181/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLIOQpmON-UGIScKRKWIwq2j4AERqMUptfAw5abABxniT2WqA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 years ago",
        "text": "Arketek was our Salesforce implementation partner and were indispensable. They've continued to work with us to tune everything since going live.\n\nWe had wanted to move to Salesforce for years, and they helped us finally make it happen by taking the time to understand our needs and then coming up with a plan to achieve them in a way that we felt we could manage.\n\nI strongly recommend them for anyone looking to implement or improve Salesforce.",
        "time": 1645999252,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Nate Peters",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103802543691340741676/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWVQDl0Xt3wjVNHrul88BTOX04cdLrtTPaglzUAJnnY4mwc2vw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "Their knowledge of salesforce and how to make it work specifically  for my biz is a breath of fresh air. After trying multiple solutions Arketek easily stands high above. Highly recommend.",
        "time": 1711252908,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Dean Braiden",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/109941016521477284087/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocK_mInsEd8kl5jxXV5IDGjSSb7l3TQUQpRYO-rlLs3KkERMOg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 years ago",
        "text": "Mike and his team is amazing! It’s rare to come across people with that level of knowledge, professionalism and handholding (this was key for us).\n\nWe couldn’t recommend the whole team more. Any company looking to work with the best Salesforce experts in the market place would find it hard to get a better company.",
        "time": 1652887547,
        "translated": false
      }
